      "notes": "Freezes the player health stat (entity+0x48, current at +0x18) at 100. The freeze runs every 100 ms, so burst damage (explosions, long falls) can still kill between ticks. A stronger form would block the decrease inside the game's SetHealth (+0x108e340), gated on the player pointer; Tamper cannot hand a capture patch's pointer to another patch, so that form is not used. Untested in-game."
